  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks. <br>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. <br>• Cook potato in boiling water over high heat until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins. <br>• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk and butter and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478dd66926770e8cd235c/step-9fef6700.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and garlic. Drain and rinse lentils. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. <br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot, onion, lentils and capsicum until softened, 5-6 mins. <br>• Reduce heat to medium-low, then add garlic, chermoula spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. <br>• Stir in coconut milk, the water and stock powder and cook, stirring, until combined, 2-3 mins. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478dd66926770e8cd235c/step-f71d5410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to high. Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish and spread evenly with mash. <br>• Drizzle with olive oil and grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478dd66926770e8cd235c/step-71b61b20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide chermoula lentil and veggie pie between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4478dd66926770e8cd235c/step-3d909e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
